{"id":"oportunidad","lemma":"oportunidad","pos":"noun","rank":314,"glosses":["opportunity, chance, shot, break, occasion, time (in both senses: “chance for advancement, progress or profit” and “favorable circumstance or occasion”)","timeliness"],"ipa":"/opoɾtuniˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"oportunidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-oportunidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Gracias por la oportunidad.","en":"Thank you for the opportunity.","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Esta será una gran oportunidad.","en":"This will be a great opportunity.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"¿Cuáles son mis oportunidades de sobrevivir?","en":"What are my chances of surviving?","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which","l":"cuál"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to survive"}]},{"text":"Esta es nuestra única oportunidad.","en":"This is our only shot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801437","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"only","l":"único"},null]},{"text":"Lo haré a la primera oportunidad.","en":"I'll do it first chance I get.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77257","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"first gear"},null]}]}